Litik: This is the path to the next town. We made it through the forest!
You: Then let's keep going.
Litik: Wait. The road ahead is blocked for now. We can't safely continue yet.
You: What about the Mystic Ylang-Ylang?
Litik: Keep it safe. We've come too far to lose it now. When the road opens, we'll travel on together.
You: Alright. I'll be ready.
[signal arg="set_flag_litik_second_town_unavailable_seen"]
[end_timeline]
